# SHA-256 of the release artefacts CI downloads.
# last-reviewed: 2026-09-11
# Source of truth for a bump: copy the digest from the project's checksums
# file where it publishes one (ShellCheck, actionlint, kubeconform, ruff).
# Hadolint ships no checksums file; the digest below is a first observation
# of v2.15.1/hadolint-linux-x86_64.
#
# These names match the env: block in .github/workflows/ci.yml. Keep them in
# lockstep when bumping a tool — a version pin without a digest still trusts
# whoever answers the URL.
#
# Both halves of that are now enforced rather than requested. Each install step
# in ci.yml looks its digest up here and runs sha256sum -c (shasum -a 256 -c on
# the macOS runner) on the artefact as downloaded, before it is unpacked, and
# fails the job on a mismatch. test-env/static/check_conventions.sh asserts at
# review time that this file and that env: block name the same tools at the same
# versions, and that every digest below is named by a step up there. That check
# exists because this file spent its whole life as prose: it declared itself the
# source of truth while nothing in the tree read it, so the two Darwin digests
# below had never been compared against anything, and a bump that edited ci.yml
# and not this file was invisible.
#
# The digests are of the release artefact exactly as the URL serves it — the
# .tar.xz or .tar.gz, not the binary inside it — except Hadolint, whose release
# is a bare binary.
#
# Tools pinned in that env: block that deliberately have no digest here, because
# they are not release binaries fetched from a URL: yamllint arrives through
# pipx from PyPI and PSScriptAnalyzer through Install-Module from the PowerShell
# Gallery, and both verify what they install. The list is machine-read by
# check_conventions.sh, so the exemption is stated once, here, beside what it
# exempts — and a tool that appears in neither this list nor the digests below
# fails that check instead of quietly installing unverified.
NO_DIGEST_TOOLS='YAMLLINT PSSA'

SHELLCHECK_VERSION=0.10.0
SHELLCHECK_SHA256_LINUX_AMD64=6c881ab0698e4e6ea235245f22832860544f17ba386442fe7e9d629f8cbedf87
SHELLCHECK_SHA256_DARWIN_ARM64=bbd2f14826328eee7679da7221f2bc3afb011f6a928b848c80c321f6046ddf81
SHELLCHECK_SHA256_DARWIN_AMD64=ef27684f23279d112d8ad84e0823642e43f838993bbb8c0963db9b58a90464c2

ACTIONLINT_VERSION=1.7.12
ACTIONLINT_SHA256_LINUX_AMD64=8aca8db96f1b94770f1b0d72b6dddcb1ebb8123cb3712530b08cc387b349a3d8

HADOLINT_VERSION=2.15.1
HADOLINT_SHA256_LINUX_AMD64=c7187db94eeeeca956519a6af171adc31453941a1e777961f6e680f697c8c507

KUBECONFORM_VERSION=0.8.0
KUBECONFORM_SHA256_LINUX_AMD64=9bc2bffbf71f261128533edaf912153948b7ff238f9a531ae6d34466ec287883

RUFF_VERSION=0.15.8
RUFF_SHA256_LINUX_AMD64=45a6ed01c5b32873d4f6239f5fd6d9adde782295261b4a65962d754b3e37a849
